<title>UK: Daiwa sets warrants on the Nikkei 225 index.</title>
<headline>Daiwa sets warrants on the Nikkei 225 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiwa Europe Ltd says it has issued 60,000 American-style call and put warrants in two equal tranches, on the Nikkei 225 index.</p>
<p>One warrant controls 10 times the index value.</p>
<p> WARRANTS    STRIKE	ISS PRICE    PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	18,000	$106.90	51.50 PCT    14.40 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT B	 16,000	$ 42.70	13.80 PCT    36.00 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   13.JUN.97		 PAYDATE	22.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUX			 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
